From baa62d3dbf26ef91fdc348caf312893b637f8cd6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:05:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] chore(github): FUNDING.yml custom takes links only

GitHub's FUNDING.yml docs: `custom` is up to four URLs, with no label
syntax. "Buy me a Token" would be read as a link. Keep the Stripe URL.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/FUNDING.yml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.github/FUNDING.yml b/.github/FUNDING.yml
index 8a37dec9..d4215fa8 100644
--- a/.github/FUNDING.yml
+++ b/.github/FUNDING.yml
@@ -1 +1 @@
-custom: ["https://buy.stripe.com/8x2dR93Up10S6eP0FO4c800", "Buy me a Token"]
\ No newline at end of file
+custom: ["https://buy.stripe.com/8x2dR93Up10S6eP0FO4c800"]
